    "There was an issue loading your data. Please do not delete the app, as this could result in permanent data loss.\n\nTry restarting the app or contact support.": {
      "comment": "An error message displayed when there is an issue loading the user's data. It instructs the user not to delete the app and provides options to restart it or contact support.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Laden Ihrer Daten ist ein Problem aufgetreten. Bitte löschen Sie die App nicht, da dies zu einem dauerhaften Datenverlust führen kann.\n\nVersuchen Sie, die App neu zu starten oder wenden Sie sich an den Support."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hubo un problema al cargar tus datos. No elimine la aplicación, ya que esto podría provocar una pérdida permanente de datos.\n\nIntente reiniciar la aplicación o comuníquese con el soporte."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un problème est survenu lors du chargement de vos données. Veuillez ne pas supprimer l'application, car cela pourrait entraîner une perte permanente de données.\n\nEssayez de redémarrer l'application ou contactez l'assistance."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si è verificato un problema durante il caricamento dei tuoi dati. Si prega di non eliminare l'app poiché ciò potrebbe comportare la perdita permanente dei dati.\n\nProva a riavviare l'app o contatta l'assistenza."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ocorreu um problema ao carregar seus dados. Não exclua o aplicativo, pois isso pode resultar na perda permanente de dados.\n\nTente reiniciar o aplicativo ou entre em contato com o suporte."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Возникла проблема при загрузке данных. Пожалуйста, не удаляйте приложение, так как это может привести к потере данных.\n\nПопробуйте перезапустить приложение или обратитесь в поддержку."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These buttons are for testing only. Remove TestDataGenerator.swift and this section after testing.": {
      "comment": "A message displayed in an alert within the settings view, explaining that the buttons are for testing purposes only and that the user should remove the `TestDataGenerator.swift` file and this section after testing.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Schaltflächen dienen nur zum Testen. Entfernen Sie TestDataGenerator.swift und diesen Abschnitt nach dem Testen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Estos botones son sólo para pruebas. Elimine TestDataGenerator.swift y esta sección después de la prueba."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces boutons sont uniquement destinés aux tests. Supprimez TestDataGenerator.swift et cette section après le test."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
